 "caveats": [
  "Image side is the shipped v3 gallery, which was projected by a head fitted against Qwen3-0.6B text on 118k pairs; the sentence encoders inherit that projection rather than a space fitted for them. The reader ladder (both sides fitted, 4k pairs) shows a larger sentence-encoder margin; this frozen-side result is the drop-in number, not the ceiling.",
  "The four encoders were trained on sentence-pair corpora that include COCO caption text (never these images or gallery rows). The 0.6B reference is a base LLM with no such exposure.",
  "Eval is the card's replay set: 5,001 val2017 captions from 1,000 images, gold = gallery row, over all 123,287 rows. Train is train2017 only; no val image is fitted. Three head-init seeds, reported mean with [min,max]; MPS matmuls are not bitwise deterministic so a re-run moves the third decimal.",
  "mpnet is excluded from this run because candle-transformers has no MPNet; the four rungs here are BERT-family and load with the same code path."
 ]
}